 "nodes": [
  {"id": "document:packages/host/README.md", "type": "document", "name": "README.md", "filePath": "packages/host/README.md", "summary": "host 包组 README：Web GUI 的 HTTP(S) 服务器、SPA dist 静态服务、目录选择缝（native/browse/adaptive 三包）、open-in-app 应用探测与启动路由、只读插件盘点投影与显式产品事件上报；浏览器传输在 client/ 组，组合应用是 apps/cli 启动 dsh-base bundle。", "tags": ["documentation", "package-group", "web-gui-host"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "document:packages/host/directory-picker/README.md", "type": "document", "name": "README.md", "filePath": "packages/host/directory-picker/README.md", "summary": "dsh-host-directory-picker 包 README：工作区目录选择缝——OS 选择器（native）或应用内浏览器（browse）二态交互；选择仅限 GUI host 不影响 agent loop；浏览器工作流一次只暴露一棵目录树。", "tags": ["documentation", "capability-seam", "directory-picker"], "complexity": "moderate"},
  {"id": "config:packages/host/directory-picker/package.json", "type": "config", "name": "package.json", "filePath": "packages/host/directory-picker/package.json", "summary": "@deepseek-ai/dsh-host-directory-picker 包清单：目录选择 Service Definition 的导出与依赖。", "tags": ["configuration", "package-manifest"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "document:packages/host/directory-picker-auto/README.md", "type": "document", "name": "README.md", "filePath": "packages/host/directory-picker-auto/README.md", "summary": "dsh-host-directory-picker-auto 包 README：每次启动解析一次主机处境并挂载匹配后端+其浏览器半体为内存根树的真实 Loader 条目；native 需无远程授权信任/仅回环绑定/非 SSH/可服务显示会话，歧义一律 browse；钉死交互=直接组合该后端。", "tags": ["documentation", "adaptive-composition", "boot-resolution"], "complexity": "moderate"},
  {"id": "config:packages/host/directory-picker-auto/package.json", "type": "config", "name": "package.json", "filePath": "packages/host/directory-picker-auto/package.json", "summary": "@deepseek-ai/dsh-host-directory-picker-auto 包清单：自适应选择器的依赖与导出。", "tags": ["configuration", "package-manifest"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "file:packages/host/directory-picker-auto/src/index.ts", "type": "file", "name": "index.ts", "filePath": "packages/host/directory-picker-auto/src/index.ts", "summary": "函数插件 directory-picker-auto（inject webServer/connection/loader）：启动时一次采样解析后端类型，按 BACKEND_PACKAGES/SURFACE_PACKAGES 把后端与客户端表面成对挂为内存根树 Loader 条目（先 backend 后 surface）；effect disposer 逆序卸载并 join 两面 fiber 的 teardown，失败重试自清理防 directoryPicker 注册冲突。", "tags": ["plugin", "adaptive-composition", "loader-entries"], "complexity": "moderate", "languageNotes": "BACKEND_PACKAGES/SURFACE_PACKAGES 是导出的固定组合词汇而非可调项——yml 行引用运行时字符串静态门看不见，verify-cordis-config 要求每个组合应用声明两个值为依赖。"},
  {"id": "function:packages/host/directory-picker-auto/src/index.ts:apply", "type": "function", "name": "apply", "filePath": "packages/host/directory-picker-auto/src/index.ts", "lineRange": [69, 112], "summary": "采样（bindHost/远程授权/平台/SSH/PATH 选择器二进制）解析后端，ctx.effect 内 create+await 两个 Loader 条目；卸载函数容忍树 teardown 已移除的条目，装载失败先卸载已建条目再抛。", "tags": ["plugin-entry", "boot-sampling", "pair-mounting"], "complexity": "moderate"},
  {"id": "file:packages/host/directory-picker-auto/src/resolve.ts", "type": "file", "name": "resolve.ts", "filePath": "packages/host/directory-picker-auto/src/resolve.ts", "summary": "后端解析纯函数：DirectoryPickerHostFacts（bindHost/远程授权/平台/ssh/env/linuxChooser）→ 'native'|'browse'；native 条件为无远程授权+回环绑定+非 SSH+可服务显示（darwin/win32 假定，linux 需 DISPLAY/WAYLAND_DISPLAY+选择器二进制），其余一切歧义归 browse。", "tags": ["pure-function", "boot-decision", "host-facts"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "function:packages/host/directory-picker-auto/src/resolve.ts:resolveDirectoryPickerBackend", "type": "function", "name": "resolveDirectoryPickerBackend", "filePath": "packages/host/directory-picker-auto/src/resolve.ts", "lineRange": [55, 61], "summary": "按事实链逐条判定：远程授权或非回环绑定即 browse；SSH 即 browse；darwin/win32 为 native；linux 需 chooser 二进制且 DISPLAY/WAYLAND_DISPLAY 存在（空导出按 shell 惯例视为未设置）才 native。", "tags": ["decision-chain", "loopback-trust"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "config:packages/host/directory-picker-auto/tsconfig.json", "type": "config", "name": "tsconfig.json", "filePath": "packages/host/directory-picker-auto/tsconfig.json", "summary": "包级 TypeScript 配置：extends 基座、rootDir src、outDir lib/types 并引用工作区依赖。", "tags": ["configuration", "typescript"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "document:packages/host/directory-picker-browse/README.md", "type": "document", "name": "README.md", "filePath": "packages/host/directory-picker-browse/README.md", "summary": "dsh-host-directory-picker-browse 包 README：无法触及 OS 选择器的用户经应用内浏览选目录——Node 标准库一层目录列表+子目录创建，主机显示零渲染；列表仅目录、名字排序、跟随目录 symlink、host 端 hidden 标志；创建非递归且校验单段路径。", "tags": ["documentation", "browser-picker", "remote-clients"], "complexity": "moderate"},
  {"id": "config:packages/host/directory-picker-browse/package.json", "type": "config", "name": "package.json", "filePath": "packages/host/directory-picker-browse/package.json", "summary": "@deepseek-ai/dsh-host-directory-picker-browse 包清单：浏览器后端的依赖与导出。", "tags": ["configuration", "package-manifest"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "document:packages/host/directory-picker-native/README.md", "type": "document", "name": "README.md", "filePath": "packages/host/directory-picker-native/README.md", "summary": "dsh-host-directory-picker-native 包 README：主机屏幕前的操作者经原生 OS 选择器选目录——macOS 脚本化 AppKit 面板（携带标准 Edit 菜单）、Linux Zenity+KDialog 回退、Windows 子进程开现代 IFileOpenDialog；远程部署改组合 browse 后端；一行组合同时注册匹配的浏览器侧交互。", "tags": ["documentation", "native-picker", "os-dialog"], "complexity": "moderate"},
  {"id": "config:packages/host/directory-picker-native/package.json", "type": "config", "name": "package.json", "filePath": "packages/host/directory-picker-native/package.json", "summary": "@deepseek-ai/dsh-host-directory-picker-native 包清单：原生选择器后端的依赖（koffi）与导出（含 ./worker CJS 子路径）。", "tags": ["configuration", "package-manifest"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "file:packages/host/directory-picker-native/src/index.ts", "type": "file", "name": "index.ts", "filePath": "packages/host/directory-picker-native/src/index.ts", "summary": "原生后端插件入口：default 导出 NativeDirectoryPicker（DirectoryPicker Service 子类），capability() 返回服务生命周期内稳定的 native 能力对象，pick 直接转发 pickNativeDirectory。", "tags": ["plugin", "service-provider", "capability-object"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "class:packages/host/directory-picker-native/src/index.ts:NativeDirectoryPicker", "type": "class", "name": "NativeDirectoryPicker", "filePath": "packages/host/directory-picker-native/src/index.ts", "lineRange": [23, 37], "summary": "DirectoryPicker 抽象服务的 native 实现（Provider 角色）：服务生命周期内复用同一 capability 对象（kind: 'native'，pick 经 dsh 无 shell 原生命令通道开选择器）。", "tags": ["service-provider", "native-capability"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "file:packages/host/directory-picker-native/src/native-picker.ts", "type": "file", "name": "native-picker.ts", "filePath": "packages/host/directory-picker-native/src/native-picker.ts", "summary": "跨平台原生单目录选择器：darwin 经 osascript JXA 跑 MAC_PANEL（先装标准 Edit 菜单使面板文本框可粘贴，prompt 只经 argv 传入）；win32 走 koffi 支持的 IFileOpenDialog 子进程（无 PowerShell 回退层）；linux zenity→kdialog 回退（退出码 1=取消，ENOENT 换下一档）；平台外抛不支持。", "tags": ["native-picker", "platform-adapters", "jxa"], "complexity": "complex", "languageNotes": "DirectoryPickerInternals 注入 platform/run/pickWin32Dialog 供确定性测试；JXA 面板激活要排进模态事件循环，提前请求会失活；取消的面板仍会报告其当前目录，仅 OK 响应读选择。"},
  {"id": "function:packages/host/directory-picker-native/src/native-picker.ts:pickNativeDirectory", "type": "function", "name": "pickNativeDirectory", "filePath": "packages/host/directory-picker-native/src/native-picker.ts", "lineRange": [93, 143], "summary": "按平台分发：osascript JXA / win32 对话框子进程 / zenity-kdialog 链（abort 先重抛、退出码 1 归一为 null 取消、ENOENT 换档、全缺抛安装提示）；返回选定绝对路径或 null。", "tags": ["platform-dispatch", "fallback-chain", "cancellation"], "complexity": "moderate"},
  {"id": "file:packages/host/directory-picker-native/src/win32-dialog-bindings.ts", "type": "file", "name": "win32-dialog-bindings.ts", "filePath": "packages/host/directory-picker-native/src/win32-dialog-bindings.ts", "summary": "koffi 背书的 Win32 绑定：ole32/user32/kernel32 COM vtable 调用（IFileOpenDialog 槽位偏移、Vista 起冻结 ABI）、GUID 小端 16 字节编码、readUtf16 经指针缓冲解 _Out_ void** 字符串、DPI 感知上下文逐级回退、closeThreadWindows 跨线程关窗服务 abort。koffi 惰性 import，非 Windows 进程永不加载。", "tags": ["koffi", "com-interop", "win32-bindings"], "complexity": "complex", "languageNotes": "koffi 3 把 _Out_ void** 值给成 BigInt 原生地址，str16 解码须先写进指针宽度缓冲；SetThreadDpiAwarenessContext 不支持时返回 NULL 而非抛错，调用方逐级级联（-4/-3/-2 语境）。"},
  {"id": "function:packages/host/directory-picker-native/src/win32-dialog-bindings.ts:loadWin32DialogBindings", "type": "function", "name": "loadWin32DialogBindings", "filePath": "packages/host/directory-picker-native/src/win32-dialog-bindings.ts", "lineRange": [94, 183], "summary": "动态 import koffi 并装载三 DLL，组装 COM 初始化（APARTMENTTHREADED）、CoCreateInstance（CLSID/IID 字节）、vtable 槽位调用与跨线程关窗能力为 Win32DialogBindings。", "tags": ["lazy-loading", "com-assembly"], "complexity": "complex"},
  {"id": "function:packages/host/directory-picker-native/src/win32-dialog-bindings.ts:closeThreadWindows", "type": "function", "name": "closeThreadWindows", "filePath": "packages/host/directory-picker-native/src/win32-dialog-bindings.ts", "lineRange": [191, 206], "summary": "向目标线程的窗口投递 WM_CLOSE 关闭模态对话框（驱动侧 abort 拉杆）。", "tags": ["wm-close", "cross-thread"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "file:packages/host/directory-picker-native/src/win32-dialog-host.ts", "type": "file", "name": "win32-dialog-host.ts", "filePath": "packages/host/directory-picker-native/src/win32-dialog-host.ts", "summary": "Win32 对话框驱动的真进程半体：spawnDialogWorker 按构建面（built 平面跑打包 CJS worker.cjs，源码平面先 bootstrap tsx）派生对话框子进程，标题经 DSH_DIALOG_TITLE 环境传递；重导出 closeThreadWindows。", "tags": ["child-process", "dual-plane-launch"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "function:packages/host/directory-picker-native/src/win32-dialog-host.ts:spawnDialogWorker", "type": "function", "name": "spawnDialogWorker", "filePath": "packages/host/directory-picker-native/src/win32-dialog-host.ts", "lineRange": [24, 32], "summary": "按 import.meta.url 扩展名分派 built/源码两种子进程启动路径，stdio 三忽略+ipc，windowsHide。", "tags": ["spawn", "plane-detection"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "file:packages/host/directory-picker-native/src/win32-dialog-logic.ts", "type": "file", "name": "win32-dialog-logic.ts", "filePath": "packages/host/directory-picker-native/src/win32-dialog-logic.ts", "summary": "IFileOpenDialog COM 会话的纯时序（绑定可注入故选择/取消/HRESULT 失败/清理顺序全平台可测）：runFolderDialog 设 FOS_PICKFOLDERS|FORCEFILESYSTEM|NOCHANGEDIR 与标题、Show 前回调 showing（线程 id 供 abort 拉杆）、HRESULT_CANCELLED 归一取消、GetResult 经 GetDisplayName 取文件系统路径并释放 COM 引用。", "tags": ["com-sequencing", "testable-logic", "dialog-lifecycle"], "complexity": "moderate"},
  {"id": "function:packages/host/directory-picker-native/src/win32-dialog-logic.ts:runFolderDialog", "type": "function", "name": "runFolderDialog", "filePath": "packages/host/directory-picker-native/src/win32-dialog-logic.ts", "lineRange": [119, 147], "summary": "按序驱动 setOptions/setTitle/Show（阻塞线程，前置 showing 回调）/resultPath/release，取消 HRESULT 归一 null，异常也走 Release 清理。", "tags": ["dialog-driving", "cleanup-ordering"], "complexity": "moderate"},
  {"id": "file:packages/host/directory-picker-native/src/win32-dialog-worker.ts", "type": "file", "name": "win32-dialog-worker.ts", "filePath": "packages/host/directory-picker-native/src/win32-dialog-worker.ts", "summary": "Win32 对话框子进程入口：本进程内阻塞模态 Show 保 host 事件循环存活，经 IPC 上报 {kind:'showing',threadId}→{kind:'done',path}|{kind:'error',message} 协议；父进程断开即 exit(0) 防孤儿对话框；顶层无 await（built 工件是 CJS 不能带 TLA）。", "tags": ["worker-entry", "ipc-protocol", "cjs-compat"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "config:packages/host/directory-picker-native/tsdown.config.ts", "type": "config", "name": "tsdown.config.ts", "filePath": "packages/host/directory-picker-native/tsdown.config.ts", "summary": "双入口 tsdown 构建：主入口 ESM（lib/types/index.js→lib），Win32 对话框 worker 单独打为 CJS 工件 lib/worker.cjs（./worker 导出），内联对话逻辑、koffi 保持外部原生 require。", "tags": ["build-system", "tsdown", "cjs-entry"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "document:packages/host/frontend-static/README.md", "type": "document", "name": "README.md", "filePath": "packages/host/frontend-static/README.md", "summary": "dsh-host-frontend-static 包 README：从配置的 dist 目录向浏览器供应构建好的 Web shell——根与配置 index 路径渲染引导 index，缺失/非文件 404、穿越 403、不支持方法 405；index 访问需有效进程 token 或浏览器 cookie，静态资产保持公开；fallback 席位同时仅一实例，第二个激活失败。", "tags": ["documentation", "static-serving", "spa-dist"], "complexity": "moderate"},
  {"id": "config:packages/host/frontend-static/package.json", "type": "config", "name": "package.json", "filePath": "packages/host/frontend-static/package.json", "summary": "@deepseek-ai/dsh-host-frontend-static 包清单：dist 静态服务的依赖与导出。", "tags": ["configuration", "package-manifest"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "file:packages/host/frontend-static/src/index.ts", "type": "file", "name": "index.ts", "filePath": "packages/host/frontend-static/src/index.ts", "summary": "函数插件 frontend-static：apply 认领 webServer fallback 席位，serveStatic 处理 GET/HEAD——路径解码+规范化后穿越拒绝（Windows 用 sep 拼前缀）、index 经 authorizeIndex（Connection 浏览器认证 303/401 捕获为 Fetch Response）+renderIndex、静态文件带 SHA-1 弱 ETag 与 no-cache、If-None-Match 命中回 304、.gz 按应用体原样发不作 Content-Encoding。", "tags": ["plugin", "static-serving", "etag-caching", "fallback-seat"], "complexity": "complex"},
  {"id": "function:packages/host/frontend-static/src/index.ts:serveStatic", "type": "function", "name": "serveStatic", "filePath": "packages/host/frontend-static/src/index.ts", "lineRange": [93, 126], "summary": "单个 dist 请求应答：目标解析与穿越拒绝、index 走授权+渲染、文件读 SHA-1 弱 ETag 与 304 协商、HEAD 无 body；仅缺失/非文件类错误归 404，其余文件系统失败上抛由 webserver 以 400 应答。", "tags": ["request-handling", "cache-negotiation"], "complexity": "moderate"},
  {"id": "function:packages/host/frontend-static/src/index.ts:apply", "type": "function", "name": "apply", "filePath": "packages/host/frontend-static/src/index.ts", "lineRange": [133, 167], "summary": "派生 dist 根/索引路径，authorizeIndex 把 Connection 的 writeHead/end 风格应答捕获成 Fetch Response（默认 401），ctx.effect 注册 webServer fallback 资源并随插件卸载撤销。", "tags": ["plugin-entry", "auth-capture", "fallback-registration"], "complexity": "moderate"},
  {"id": "document:packages/host/open-in-app/README.md", "type": "document", "name": "README.md", "filePath": "packages/host/open-in-app/README.md", "summary": "dsh-host-open-in-app 包 README：与浏览器伴侣配合让用户在已装编辑器/Git GUI/终端/文件管理器中打开工作区目录——固定应用目录只显示主机可验证的条目，新装应用重启后出现、缺失启动器检出即移除；请求需部署浏览器认证+主机源信任；检测与启动命令带可配置时限且不向被启动应用传递继承凭据。", "tags": ["documentation", "app-launcher", "verification"], "complexity": "moderate"},
  {"id": "config:packages/host/open-in-app/package.json", "type": "config", "name": "package.json", "filePath": "packages/host/open-in-app/package.json", "summary": "@deepseek-ai/dsh-host-open-in-app 包清单：应用打开能力的依赖与导出。", "tags": ["configuration", "package-manifest"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "file:packages/host/open-in-app/src/catalog.ts", "type": "file", "name": "catalog.ts", "filePath": "packages/host/open-in-app/src/catalog.ts", "summary": "编译期可启动应用目录（纯数据）：OpenInAppLaunch（argv 分离启动+{path} token / shell-open 走系统 open 动词）与十种 locator（fixed/app/xcode/cli/file/scan/app-paths/install-record/github-desktop/desktop），每种都解析到主机实际持有的工件而非裸安装记录；jetBrains 工厂生成三平台产品条目；菜单序含文件管理器/编辑器 IDE/Git GUI/终端。", "tags": ["data-catalog", "launch-spec", "locators"], "complexity": "complex", "languageNotes": "Linux desktop 条目的 Icon= 键拥有图标；文件管理器用 shell-open 因为 explorer.exe 直启不可靠弹窗；平台解析在 resolver.ts、图标提取在 icons.ts。"},
  {"id": "function:packages/host/open-in-app/src/catalog.ts:jetBrains", "type": "function", "name": "jetBrains", "filePath": "packages/host/open-in-app/src/catalog.ts", "lineRange": [151, 171], "summary": "JetBrains 产品条目工厂：macOS 已知 bundle 名（直装+Toolbox 拼写）、Windows 最新版本化 %ProgramFiles%/JetBrains 扫描或已验证 Uninstall 记录、Linux PATH 命令或 Toolbox shell 脚本。", "tags": ["factory", "jetbrains", "cross-platform"], "complexity": "moderate"}
 ],
